      "content": "**This is likely due to the fact that, the key for KV transfer only depends on prompt_token_ids; Where number of placeholder tokens in it would be the same for different images with the same image size. I think this issue happen not only in SharedStorageConnector, but in V1 PD disagg in general? Since I didn't find any design specifically for multimodal V1 PD disagg?**",
