      "caption_locator": null,
      "content": "This difference accumulates across many layers, resulting in nondeterministic output when the batch size changes.\nSimilarly, when prefix caching is enabled, it can also dispatch to different kernels.\nEven when the computations are mathematically equivalent, small numerical differences from different kernel implementations lead to the final nondeterministic outputs.",
